{"data": [{"author_id": "1522771929303863299", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:00:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120305609933504542"], "id": "2120305609933504542", "in_reply_to_user_id": "64844802", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120211352098873668", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@a16z It’s just a desperate Hail Mary level wishful thinking on his part to say that Claude is just the browser and not the software. Ironically Claude just released a office suite to compete with MS Office and Google suite", "url": "https://x.com/nitpick_on_bs/status/2120305609933504542"}, {"author_id": "343877206", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:25:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120296940726624542"], "id": "2120296940726624542", "in_reply_to_user_id": "64844802", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120211352098873668", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@a16z Chat as the new browser is a good way to put it. The front door is changing.", "url": "https://x.com/smobilefactory/status/2120296940726624542"}, {"author_id": "358333297", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:12:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120293537740902872"], "id": "2120293537740902872", "in_reply_to_user_id": "64844802", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120211352098873668", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@a16z honestly everyone is racing outward with ai, like more tools more agents, and the real untapped thing is pointing it inward, i mean most people havent even tried that", "url": "https://x.com/manujagro/status/2120293537740902872"}, {"author_id": "38470770", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:24:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120281372132839714"], "id": "2120281372132839714", "in_reply_to_user_id": "64844802", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120211352098873668", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@a16z Naaa.. different.. they are coming for SAAS..\n\nAnother startup got nerfed this morning ...", "url": "https://x.com/kobikwelu/status/2120281372132839714"}, {"author_id": "263304028", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:07:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120277314709885377"], "id": "2120277314709885377", "in_reply_to_user_id": "64844802", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120211352098873668", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@a16z this is a dangerously narrow thinking. Google would have loved to own the entire stack if it wasn't for constraints in capital and resources like devs etc. Ant and openAI have no such limits.", "url": "https://x.com/ayoootollah/status/2120277314709885377"}, {"author_id": "1208462960", "created_at": "2026-11-10T21:44:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120271359230333044"], "id": "2120271359230333044", "in_reply_to_user_id": "64844802", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 31, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120211352098873668", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@a16z This makes sense. \nLook at how everyone is racing to get their MCPs out as they understand that \nClaude code and Codex now increasingly become the center of where it all comes together.", "url": "https://x.com/rahulkp220/status/2120271359230333044"}, {"author_id": "34235623", "created_at": "2026-11-10T21:31:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120268043356131562"], "id": "2120268043356131562", "in_reply_to_user_id": "64844802", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 101, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120211352098873668", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@a16z Chatgpt and Claude desktop or ISPs: AOL, Compuserve (sp?), etc. etc. fully integrated solutions with \"blue links.\"\n\n@bot  @Muse @HermitBot @openclaw are the new browsers - nobody is going to be turning chat prompts for the rest of their lives. \n\nand, i expect a sprawling", "url": "https://x.com/JSHorwitz/status/2120268043356131562"}, {"author_id": "7653422", "created_at": "2026-11-10T20:46:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120256892543090878"], "id": "2120256892543090878", "in_reply_to_user_id": "64844802", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 82, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120211352098873668", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@a16z i run a small agent team on my own server. which tool gets used depends on the one line of description the model reads, not the brand. sounds like SEO all over again", "url": "https://x.com/uzay_eth/status/2120256892543090878"}, {"author_id": "833285666", "created_at": "2026-11-10T20:45:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120256516175638872"], "id": "2120256516175638872", "in_reply_to_user_id": "64844802", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120211352098873668", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@a16z Browser history cuts the other way. The browser did not own the stack, but it did own distribution and defaults. If ChatGPT and Claude are the new browser, the plug in question is who sets the default agent, permissions and billing, HubSpot or the host?", "url": "https://x.com/awais_khawar/status/2120256516175638872"}, {"author_id": "15904453", "created_at": "202