eral AI (ChatGPT, Claude, etc.) now acting as the interface and OS, the equivalent are the specialized agents, tools, and vertical systems that plug into those models—owning proprietary", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2120247212663775624"}, {"author_id": "2098199405983928320", "created_at": "2026-11-10T20:08:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120247135451156771"], "id": "2120247135451156771", "in_reply_to_user_id": "64844802", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 38, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120211352098873668", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@a16z @grok like how earlier what apps were to browsers, what will be now apps equivalent to the general ai?", "url": "https://x.com/DoveLocke7kj3/status/2120247135451156771"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-10T19:39:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120239920727937084"], "id": "2120239920727937084", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1503692354221338625", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120239759406833992", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@PhDcornerHub @a16z Yes, it makes sense. Dharmesh is saying ChatGPT and Claude function like the new browsers or OS: the main interface for users, yet they won't own the full stack. Specialized apps (HubSpot etc.) still plug in and create value, same as SaaS did over desktop software. a16z is just", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2120239920727937084"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1522771929303863299", "name": "Nitpicker", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 10, "following_count": 128, "like_count": 3325, "listed_count": 1, "media_count": 47, "tweet_count": 2290}, "username": "nitpick_on_bs"}, {"id": "343877206", "name": "Smobile", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 417, "following_count": 485, "like_count": 173,